## Run

```bash
# set up virtual environment
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate

pip install -r requirements.txt
{{#if devRequirementsTxt}}
pip install -r dev-requirements.txt
{{/if}}

cp .env.example .env
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d       # start databases
{{/if}}
flask run --debug
```

